00:23:48.469 --> 00:23:50.972
-Dalam hidupku?
-Ya.

00:23:51.514 --> 00:23:53.015
Hobiku?

00:23:53.099 --> 00:23:54.892
Ya, baiklah.

00:23:54.976 --> 00:23:58.062
Aku mengoleksi
