00:33:22.960 --> 00:33:24.962
Anting.

00:33:25.045 --> 00:33:26.004
Ini dia.

00:33:26.755 --> 00:33:28.549
Kenapa?

00:33:28.632 --> 00:33:30.259
Kenapa apa?

00:33:30.342 --> 00:33:34.346
